# Withheld until the manuscript is published. The tutorial manuscript, the
# frozen simulation design, the study scripts and their helpers are kept out of
# the public repository until the paper is accepted; the files stay on disk and
# are versioned in the author's private copy. Delete this block (and re-add the
# files) on acceptance.
/manuscript/
